{"id":"n1-009","title":"A にしろ B にしろ","romaji":"A nishiro B nishiro","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'whether it is A or B'; 'regardless of A or B'.","longExplanation":"A にしろ B にしろ is used to indicate that even though A and B are different possibilities, the statement or conclusion applies regardless. Often translated as 'whether it’s A or B' or 'regardless of A or B'.","formation":"Noun A + にしろ + Noun B + にしろ, or Verb-casual A + にしろ + Verb-casual B + にしろ","examples":[{"jp":"暑いにしろ寒いにしろ、毎日運動するべきです。","romaji":"Atsui ni shiro samui ni shiro, mainichi undou suru beki desu.","en":"Whether it's hot or cold, you should exercise every day.","words":[{"surface":"暑い","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しろ","vocabId":"1474900","reading":"しろ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"寒い","vocabId":"1210360","reading":"さむい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しろ","vocabId":"1474900","reading":"しろ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"べき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"べし"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,4,5]},{"jp":"合格するにしろ不合格になるにしろ、最善を尽くしました。","romaji":"Goukaku suru ni shiro fukougaku ni naru ni shiro, saizen o tsukushimashita.","en":"Whether I pass or fail, I did my best.","words":[{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しろ","vocabId":"1474900","reading":"しろ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"不","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しろ","vocabId":"1474900","reading":"しろ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"最善","vocabI